        }
      },
      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Recto margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>the owner of the iq\u1e6d\u0101\u02bf, upon the arrival of this note,</li>\n<li>to secure his release, that no one should harrass him,</li>\n<li>and that his animal&mdash;or his money&mdash;be restored to him.</li>\n<li>And that you know of what is due, by right, to our master Shaykh</li>\n<li>al-Ra\u02be\u012bs Ab\u016b al-Ri\u1e0d\u0101; for if this matter</li>\n<li>is repeated against him [&hellip;].</li></ol>\n\n<p></p>",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
